      "claim": "No closure excuses any of this detour. The traffic advisory artifact for this trip, EV-ADVIS-00101-01, is MISSING with weight 0.0: no LTA advisory was issued for the AYE/MCE/ECP corridor in the 10:14-10:59 window. With no advisory there is no road named, no validity window and no shortest_lawful_alternative_km, so POL-RD-03 cannot be run and none of the 6.18 km excess is exonerated. The absence is itself the citable fact.",
